  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Thresholds by Tower, Sub-tower and LOB",
      "items": [
        "rule_version holds each rule's default; rule_override holds one rule's settings for one Tower, Sub-tower or LOB, versioned.",
        "Per setting, the most specific value wins: LOB → Sub-tower → Tower → default. A null column inherits.",
        "Agent rules use the agent's home queue; queue rules also run per overridden group on its rolled-up numbers; the system rule has no overrides."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Queue-to-LOB mapping",
      "items": [
        "queue_lob_map stores the Admin upload: sheet \"Queue-to-LOB mapping\", columns Tower, Sub-tower, LOB, Queue (+ Region, Org).",
        "An upload replaces only the towers in the file; on a duplicate queue the first row wins.",
        "No FK to queue: the mapping can name a queue before the feed finds it. queue.name_key = queue_lob_map.queue_key."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Decisions built in",
      "items": [
        "One shift per org per Eastern day; strikes live per shift, so they restart at zero at midnight.",
        "Every strike from 3 on opens its own incident: incident_log.instance_id is unique. INC-YYYY-NNNN restarts each January, one counter for every org.",
        "source_event_stream keeps today only and is emptied with TRUNCATE at midnight Eastern. CSV replays are never saved."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Built today",
      "items": [
        "Phase 0 is merged: genesys_region, genesys_org, notification_route, notification_route_step, rules_master, rule_version, status_mapping, audit_event.",
        "Everything else is a new migration; the Phase 0 migration is never edited.",
        "Full design and build order: docs/ideal-dataflow.md."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
